---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="没找到页面" description="这个页面不存在，回去看看作品吧">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-24 text-center sm:px-8">
    <p class="section-kicker">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">这里什么也没有</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">链接可能写错了，或者页面被挪走了。不如回去玩点能玩的。</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm">回首页</a>
      <a href="/projects/" class="btn-ghost px-6 py-3 text-sm">去试玩 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
